---
// You do / It does split.
---
<div class="wc-split">
 <div class="wc-split-you">
  <p class="wc-split-kicker">You do <span>once</span></p>
  <ul>
   <li>The <b>15-minute</b> Quick Start, or about an hour to customize it</li>
   <li>Pick Claude, ChatGPT or both</li>
   <li>Choose automatic, or approve each look first</li>
   <li>Leave your computer on and signed into Amazon</li>
   <li>Go to bed</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
 <div class="wc-split-it">
  <p class="wc-split-kicker">It does <span>every night</span></p>
  <ul>
   <li>Plans <b>2 looks</b></li>
   <li>Makes 3 photos per look: Basic, Styled and Lifestyle</li>
   <li>Makes <b>6 Pinterest pins</b>, each linked to the themed Idea List its products came from</li>
   <li>Writes a blog post for each look</li>
   <li>Posts an Instagram carousel</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
</div>
